# Group 16 NIDS Monitoring & Maintenance Plan

## 1. System Health Monitoring
- HTTP 500 error rate threshold: < 2.0%
- p95 Inference Latency threshold: < 800ms

## 2. Statistical & Drift Monitoring
- Feature Drift: Kolmogorov-Smirnov test (drift alert threshold > 30% features shifted)
- Prediction Drift: Population Stability Index (PSI > 0.25 triggers retraining alert)
- Logging Isolation: Production logs stored in `predictions.db` with `is_simulated = 1` flag for synthetic verification records.

## 3. Retraining Governance
- Triggered quarterly or upon persistent drift alerts.
- Human-in-the-loop validation gate required prior to MLflow artifact registration.
